  "fullDescription": "Soft Procreate Color Palette – Sunset Kiss\n30 carefully hand picked colors in 1 .swatches file for Procreate app. This versatile color palette features a combination of muted sunset tones, carefully curated to enhance your digital art. It includes a blend of soft purple and dark red shades, deep yellow-brown and orange tones, brown and matching hues, perfect for creating a range of styles, from illustrations to lettering. Whether you’re working on romantic summer projects or retro, vintage designs, this palette will make color selection quick and easy, giving you the perfect shades every time. Get inspired and elevate your creative process with these easy-to-install and ready-to-use swatches!\n\n_______________________________\n***What you will get***\n1 ZIP-file includes:\n\n◼ 1 PPROCREATE COLOR PALETTE (30 colors)\nFormat: .swatches\n_______________________________\nPlease note:\n▪ Fonts, text, mockups, photos and preview scenes are not included. They are for demonstration purpose only.\n▪ This color palette is ONLY compatible with Procreate app for iPad.\n▪ Colors depicted on the preview are slightly changed (muted/darkened with shadow). After purchase you will get the file with perfect and clear colors.\n▪ This is a digital download, no physical item will be sent.\n_______________________________\nPlease feel free to contact me if you have any questions. I’d be happy to help you.\nThank you. And have a nice day!\nOlya Haifisch",
